{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0059","name":"赵威孙","evidence":["liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"liusima-m2-3ff1c123c3d539334d83","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-37b970b5946000246b1a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3a2ad656b0ce7d58bacd","layer":"original","quote":"到，谓父老曰：“董卓悖逆，为天下所仇，此忠臣义士奋发之时也。郡与京都，境壤相接；洛东有成皋，北界大河；天下兴义兵者若未得进，其势必停于此。此乃四分五裂战争之地，难以自安。不如及道路尚通，举宗东到黎阳。黎阳有营兵〖8〗，赵威孙，乡里旧婚，为监营谒者〖9〗，统兵马，足以为主。若后有变，徐复观望，未晚也","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":179,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
